#MOBILE
Vnum       33000
Keywords   sith lord tomb ancient dark~
Short      an entombed Sith Lord~
Long       The spirit of an entombed Sith Lord rises here, its hatred still burning.
~
Desc       Death has not diminished this being. Once a great lord of the Sith,
it has existed in the dark side for millennia, its consciousness
sustained by the sheer intensity of its hatred and ambition. Its
form flickers between solid and spectral and the air around it
drops several degrees. Its eyes are points of cold red light and
it regards you with the absolute contempt of something that
considers all living things beneath it.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary truesight pass_door~
Stats1     3000 107 0 98 100 0
Stats2     60 60 3000
Stats3     0 0 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    22 22 22 22 22 22 0 100
Saves      -25 -25 -25 -25 -25
Speaks     common ancient~
Speaking   ancient~
VIPFlags   korriban~
Immune     sleep charm~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33001
Keywords   sith acolyte dark side student~
Short      a Sith Academy acolyte~
Long       A Sith Academy acolyte moves with aggressive purpose through the corridor.
~
Desc       Young, ambitious, and already corrupted by the dark side, this
acolyte has survived the brutal selection process of the Korriban
Academy. Their eyes carry the amber tint of dark side immersion
and their bearing is one of coiled aggression barely held in check.
They size you up with the calculating look of someone who sees
every other being as either a resource or an obstacle.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden~
Stats1     800 102 0 90 95 0
Stats2     40 40 800
Stats3     0 0 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    18 18 18 18 18 18 0 85
Saves      -18 -18 -18 -18 -18
Speaks     common~
Speaking   common~
VIPFlags   korriban~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33002
Keywords   sith overseer instructor academy~
Short      a Sith Overseer~
Long       A Sith Overseer patrols here, watching the acolytes with cold assessment.
~
Desc       The Overseers of the Sith Academy are among the most dangerous
beings on Korriban. They have survived everything the planet and
the Order has thrown at them over long years of service and they
have the scars and the power to prove it. This one watches you
with the particular attention of someone who is already calculating
how useful you might be and what it would take to break you.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary~
Stats1     1500 105 0 95 98 0
Stats2     50 50 1500
Stats3     0 0 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    20 20 20 20 20 20 0 95
Saves      -22 -22 -22 -22 -22
Speaks     common ancient~
Speaking   common~
VIPFlags   korriban~
Immune     sleep charm~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33003
Keywords   tuk'ata hound tomb beast dark~
Short      a tuk'ata tomb guardian~
Long       A massive tuk'ata stalks here, its dark-side corrupted eyes fixed on you.
~
Desc       The tuk'ata are the legendary tomb guardians of Korriban — massive
predators that have been exposed to Sith alchemy and dark side energy
for so long that they have become something beyond natural. This one
is enormous, its shoulders at chest height, its hide thick with
bone-like protrusions. It does not make a sound as it moves toward
you. The silence is worse than any growl would be.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden~
Stats1     1200 103 0 95 97 0
Stats2     55 55 1200
Stats3     0 0 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    25 20 22 14 14 14 0 80
Saves      -20 -20 -20 -20 -20
Speaks     common~
Speaking   common~
VIPFlags   korriban~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33004
Keywords   shyrack flying cave beast dark~
Short      a shyrack~
Long       A shyrack swoops through the cave, its screeching cutting the darkness.
~
Desc       The shyrack is a flying cave-dweller native to Korriban, its body
like a ray compressed into something reptilian and wrong. In the
dark side environment of Korriban they have grown larger and more
aggressive than their counterparts elsewhere. They hunt in groups
and are relentless once they have fixed on prey.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive~
Affected   detect_invis~
Stats1     600 100 0 88 92 0
