Saves      -16 -16 -16 -16 -16
Speaks     common~
Speaking   common~
VIPFlags   korriban~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33005
Keywords   sith lord darth naga sadow~
Short      the spirit of Naga Sadow~
Long       The spirit of Dark Lord Naga Sadow stands here, ancient power radiating from his form.
~
Desc       One of the greatest Dark Lords of the old Sith Empire, Naga Sadow
fought and lost a war against the Republic thousands of years ago
but his power has never diminished. His spirit has been bound to
Korriban since his death and he is stronger here than most living
Sith will ever be. He regards you with the vast contempt of someone
who has outlasted every enemy he has ever had and expects to outlast
you as well.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     male~
Actflags   npc aggressive sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary truesight pass_door~
Stats1     5000 107 0 100 100 0
Stats2     80 80 5000
