Saves      -30 -30 -30 -30 -30
Speaks     ancient common~
Speaking   ancient~
VIPFlags   korriban~
Immune     sleep charm nonmagic magic~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33006
Keywords   sith lord tulak hord~
Short      the spirit of Tulak Hord~
Long       The spirit of Tulak Hord looms here, his form crackling with dark side lightning.
~
Desc       Known in life as the Lord of Hate, Tulak Hord was considered the
greatest lightsaber duelist of his era. In death his spirit retains
everything that made him lethal. He is enormous even as a spirit,
his presence filling the chamber like smoke, and the dark lightning
that plays across his form leaves scorch marks on the stone. He
has been waiting in his tomb for a very long time and does not
appear pleased by the interruption.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     male~
Actflags   npc aggressive sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary truesight pass_door~
Stats1     5500 107 0 100 100 0
Stats2     85 85 5500
Stats3     0 0 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
Attribs    25 25 25 25 25 25 0 100
Saves      -30 -30 -30 -30 -30
Speaks     ancient common~
Speaking   ancient~
VIPFlags   korriban~
Immune     sleep charm nonmagic magic~
#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33007
Keywords   sith warrior guard tomb~
Short      a Sith tomb warrior~
Long       A Sith tomb warrior stands guard here, animated by the dark side.
~
Desc       Not quite a spirit and not quite a corpse, the tomb warriors of
Korriban exist in a state maintained entirely by the dark side energy
that saturates the valley. They were warriors in life and they remain
warriors in death, their technique undimmed by the millennia. They
do not speak and they do not negotiate.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden~
Stats1     2000 106 0 96 99 0
Stats2     65 65 2000
Stats3     0 0 0
Stats4     0 0 0 0 0
