#ENDMOBILE

#MOBILE
Vnum       33008
Keywords   sith headmaster darth academy~
Short      the Academy Headmaster~
Long       The Academy Headmaster stands here, his authority absolute and his patience nonexistent.
~
Desc       The Headmaster of the Korriban Sith Academy holds a position that
has been filled by some of the most powerful Sith in history. This
one has held it long enough to have buried three predecessors and
seven would-be replacements. Their power is self-evident and their
expectation that you will either serve or die is communicated
entirely by their expression.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive sentinel~
Affected   detect_invis detect_hidden sanctuary truesight~
