#MOBILE
Vnum       33009
Keywords   sith hound beast wasteland~
Short      a Korriban hound~
Long       A lean and vicious Korriban hound prowls here, its eyes burning red.
~
Desc       The surface hounds of Korriban are smaller than the tomb-dwelling
tuk'ata but no less dangerous in the open wastelands. Dark side
exposure over generations has made them something the galaxy would
not recognise as a natural animal. They hunt in packs, they do not
tire, and the wounds they leave resist conventional healing.
~
Race       Human~
Position   aggressive~
DefPos     aggressive~
Gender     neuter~
Actflags   npc aggressive~
