#OBJECT
Vnum       33000
Keywords   sith holocron dark ancient~
Short      an ancient Sith holocron~
Long       An ancient Sith holocron pulses with cold dark energy here.~
Type       armor~
Flags      magic glow~
WFlags     take hold~
Values     0 15 0 0 0 0
Stats      10 25000 2500 0 0
Affect         -1 -1 10 13 0
Affect         -1 -1 10 14 0
Affect         -1 -1 8 3 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey  holocron sith dark ancient~
ExDesc     A pyramidal Sith holocron from the era of the old Sith Empire,
its surface covered in ancient script and cold to the touch. The
gatekeeper within is ancient and hostile, imparting knowledge
with the contempt of something that views the recipient as
unworthy but unavoidably necessary. What it teaches is
extraordinarily powerful and profoundly dangerous.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       33001
Keywords   sith sword ancient dark corroded~
Short      an ancient Sith war sword~
Long       An ancient Sith war sword lies here, its metal dark and humming.~
Type       weapon~
Flags      magic~
WFlags     take wield~
Values     5 40 80 2 0 8000
Stats      10 30000 3000 0 0
Affect         -1 -1 15 13 0
Affect         -1 -1 15 14 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey  sword sith war ancient dark~
ExDesc     A Sith war sword from the era of the old Sith Empire, its metal
worked using Sith alchemy to a hardness beyond ordinary steel.
The blade vibrates at a frequency audible only as a vague unease
and it draws the eye in a way that is not entirely natural. It
has cut through things for thousands of years and shows no sign
of wear. The dark side energy bound into it is significant.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       33002
Keywords   sith armor dark lord ancient~
Short      ancient Sith battle armour~
Long       A set of ancient Sith battle armour rests here on a collapsed stand.~
Type       armor~
Flags      magic~
WFlags     take body~
Values     80 80 0 0 0 0
Stats      10 28000 2800 0 0
Affect         -1 -1 -35 12 0
Affect         -1 -1 6 5 0
Affect         -1 -1 5 1 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey  armour sith battle ancient dark lord~
ExDesc     Sith battle armour worked with alchemy to be harder than durasteel
at a fraction of the weight. The surface is covered in runes of
protection and power and the metal has absorbed thousands of years
of dark side energy. Wearing it creates a subtle but persistent
sense of invulnerability that is, according to available evidence,
not entirely unjustified.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       33003
Keywords   sith amulet power dark lord~
Short      a Sith Lord's power amulet~
Long       A Sith Lord's power amulet lies here, radiating cold dark energy.~
Type       armor~
Flags      magic glow~
WFlags     take neck~
Values     10 10 0 0 0 0
Stats      10 22000 2200 0 0
Affect         -1 -1 8 1 0
Affect         -1 -1 8 5 0
Affect         -1 -1 6 4 0
#EXDESC
ExDescKey  amulet sith power dark lord~
ExDesc     An amulet worn by a Sith Lord of the old Empire, its setting
carved from bone-white stone found only in the deepest tombs.
The dark side energy bound into it is palpable — wearing it
creates a pressure at the temples and a clarity that is not
entirely comfortable. The power it imparts is real and so is
the sense that something imparted it deliberately, and for a price.
~
#ENDEXDESC
#ENDOBJECT

#OBJECT
Vnum       33004
Keywords   sith gauntlets dark power ancient~
Short      Sith alchemical gauntlets~
Long       A pair of Sith alchemical gauntlets rests here.~
Type       armor~
Flags      magic~
WFlags     take hands~
Values     50 50 0 0 0 0
Stats      10 20000 2000 0 0
