Desc     A natural rocky platform at the valley entrance providing a view back
toward the spaceport and Dreshdae. From here the contrast between the
mundane infrastructure of the occupied planet and the ancient weight
of the valley behind you is most clearly felt. The dark side at your
back and the functioning present ahead. Korriban in summary.
~
